@title STORY • LOGAN: THROUGH THE VIEWFINDER
@bg darkroom_night
You're Logan Kim. The campus darkroom smells like chemicals and calm. You develop your film here every Thursday.
Tonight's roll: the team. London glaring at Holloway. Diggy laughing with his whole face. Maggie mid-hug. Shane crying at a dinner. Noah staring at mountains.
You've never shown anyone. You don't know why you take them. You just know you'd be sad if you didn't.
Your phone: Mom. "Logan-ah, did you call your grandmother? She asked about you."
> [Sweet] Call Halmeoni. Right now. -> a1
> [Good] "sunday mom. promise." -> a2
*a1
@add Family 3
Halmeoni: (in Korean) My quiet boy! Are you taking pictures still?
Logan: Yes, Halmeoni.
Halmeoni: Send me one. Of a girl.
Logan: Halmeoni.
Halmeoni: Of a FRIEND. Fine.
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Family 1
Mom: "ok. eat dinner. you forget when you're in that dark room."
She's right. You do.
*a_done
@bg campus_quad_day
@show maggie
Maggie: Logan! Is that a CAMERA? Since when do you have a camera?
Logan: ...Since eighth grade.
Maggie: And you've NEVER shown us anything? That's illegal. Show me right now.
> [Bold] Hand her the whole envelope. -> b1
> [Good] Show her one. The one of her hugging Shane. -> b2
> [Sweet] "...They're not very good." -> b3
*b1
@add Courage 3
Maggie goes through every single one. She doesn't talk. Maggie always talks. When she gets to the one of Shane crying at Thanksgiving, she starts crying too.
Maggie: Logan. You see us. Like, really see us.
@jump b_done
*b2
@add Maggie_Bond 2
Maggie: (staring at it) I didn't know I looked like that when I'm happy.
Logan: You always look like that.
@jump b_done
*b3
Maggie: (snatching one anyway) Shut up, this is incredible.
*b_done
@show coachbrooks
A week later, Coach Brooks asks if you'd shoot the team photos for the banquet. Maggie told her. Of course Maggie told her.
> [Good] "Yes." -> c1
> [Sweet] "...Only if I can stay behind the camera." -> c2
*c1
@add Courage 2
The banquet slideshow is all your photos. When it ends, the room is silent. Then London Sterling, of all people, starts clapping first.
@jump end
*c2
Coach Brooks: Deal. But at the end, you're in one. Team rule.
At the end, Maggie grabs the camera and takes one of you. You're laughing in it. You didn't know you looked like that either.
*end
Logan Kim says almost nothing. He's been telling the team he loves them the whole time, one photograph at a time.
